From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wave: preserve Linux netdev and bridge ownership

Preserve ordinary Linux bridge forwarding, hairpin and accepted counters.
Keep proc readers and private netdev state alive through native retirement.
Register native notification events without the optional vendor command ABI.

This is the final native integration against the pinned vendor source.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>

